---
import { wa } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="sec" id="media"><div class="wrap media">
  <figure class="media-cover"><img src="/media-profile-cover.webp" alt="Cover page of a guest profile prepared for Muhammed Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury, titled Sales Turnaround Strategist and Channel Growth Architect" width="560" height="725" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Sample: Mehdi's guest profile</figcaption></figure>
  <div class="media-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">Second service</span>
    <h2>Media &amp; <em>Guest Profile.</em></h2>
    <p>A producer-ready profile for senior professionals, for when you are invited to speak. It puts your story in the form a host or organiser needs.</p>
    <ul><li>Positioning and headline numbers</li><li>Interview angles</li><li>A booking page</li><li>Built for podcasts, panels and keynotes</li></ul>
    <a class="cta cta-gold" href={wa('Hi Shuvo, I would like a quote for a media and guest profile.')} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Request a quote</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
